# .cursorignore — HARD block (Agent, Tab, Inline Edit, @ mentions cannot access these).
# Purpose: keep secrets and never-touch runtime state completely out of any AI surface.
#
# Cursor already respects .gitignore and ships default ignores (lock files, env files,
# build output, binaries, media, node_modules/, __pycache__/, .git/). This file only adds
# what must be *blocked entirely*, not merely de-indexed — de-indexable noise lives in
# .cursorindexingignore so the Agent can still open it on demand.
#
# Negation caveat (Cursor docs): `!` cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded
# by a `*` wildcard. The `!.env.template` line works only because no parent is wildcarded.

# ── Secrets & credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scoped to credential file *shapes*, not name substrings: broad globs like *token* or
# *secret* would wrongly block legitimate source (e.g. token_service.py, secrets_manager.py).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.template
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pkcs12
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa
**/id_rsa.pub
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ed25519.pub
**/*.pgpass
**/credentials.json
**/gha-creds-*.json
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc

# ── Local agent-config overlays (gitignored; may carry API keys / personal tokens) ─────
# .gitignore only de-indexes these; hard-block the Agent surface too — same defense-in-depth
# rationale as the secrets above. (.cursorignore is Cursor-only, so this does not affect how
# Claude Code loads its own settings.local.json / CLAUDE.local.md.)
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/CLAUDE.local.md

# ── Local Python runtime & caches (never useful to the Agent) ─────────────────
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/env/
**/ENV/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*$py.class
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.hypothesis/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/
**/.cache/
**/.uv/
**/.logfire/

# ── Agent hook runtime logs (may capture command output / tokens) ─────────────
**/hooks/logs/

# ── OS & editor noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
